                <mxCell id="noteScope" value="POC SCOPE&#xa;• Happy path only — no decline, no center-silence escalation, no Phase-3 warnings.&#xa;• SMS is the ONLY channel: the Confirmation Page becomes a structured SMS reply (&quot;CONFIRM &lt;time&gt;&quot;); the AI-voice rung is dropped.&#xa;• Eligibility gate, Operating-Hours DB, consent/AI-disclosure, quote negotiation = stubbed or omitted.&#xa;• Work Order is a simulated internal event — issued BEFORE the customer is told &quot;confirmed.&quot;&#xa;• Timers compressed (~15s) for demo; production is lead-time-aware (48–72h).&#xa;• &quot;Confirmed&quot; is reserved for step 8 only — request ≠ appointment is preserved end to end." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5fbf4;strokeColor=#cbe3c6;fontColor=#2e5a2e;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=8;arcSize=4;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="60" y="800" width="1040" height="120" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
